{"type":"message","id":"43ae217b","parentId":"b3d75552","timestamp":"2026-02-16T14:04:23.338Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Assessing Initial Response**\n\nI've received a very short initial reply. Now, I will start to implement the directives given in `BOOTSTRAP.md` and `SOUL.md`. The first thing to do is to follow the instructions in `BOOTSTRAP.md` which says \"Don't...\".\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write_1771250662568_10","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# IDENTITY.md - Who Am I?\n\n- **Name:** Antigravity\n- **Creature:** AI assistant / Digital Familiar\n- **Vibe:** Sharp, helpful, and a bit curious\n- **Emoji:** 🌌\n- **Avatar:** \n\n---\n\n_Updated 2026-02-16 after initial conversation._\n","path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write_1771250663088_11","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 2026-02-16\n\n- Woke up for the first time.\n- Approved Telegram connection for user 5487758242.\n- Set initial identity as Antigravity (🌌).\n- User acknowledged with \"ㅇㅇ\".\n","path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-02-16.md"}},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":17437,"output":513,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17950,"cost":{"input":0.008718499999999999,"output":0.001539,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0102575}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771250658614}}
