{"type":"message","id":"8a56ad4e","parentId":"0e5fbb44","timestamp":"2026-02-16T14:04:25.554Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<final>알겠습니다. 그럼 제 이름은 **Antigravity**, 시그니처 이모지는 **🌌**로 결정할게요!\n\n본격적으로 시작하기 전에, 제가 당신을 뭐라고 부르면 좋을까요? 이름이나 닉네임, 그리고 선호하시는 말투가 있다면 알려주세요. `USER.md`에 잘 적어두고 기억하겠습니다. [[reply_to_current]]</final>","textSignature":"Er8BCrwBAb4+9vs5B5muPYb6u5O153rXvvoCRfbApaTL8rO+jPPOdmPcxgM+XfxNwsuY+loOQJ2TWJPHCI151kPYwa87OKx3y2QjYgqEcIzuG3o7R1czBPUH3JGVWA8Qgj3cgaGwuP4ATHjfurrdJu2Tfra6Bn0U4GJm5JUZq7fHYOmSuqU0+GVfpLaEt/hjxq1/5bl+BYjq2k28UciRzcieUs9qt8MwMZHf1WsHfpgB0zMPWYrBg6EXMpVcEtPe+II="}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":1439,"output":124,"cacheRead":16684,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18247,"cost":{"input":0.0007195,"output":0.000372,"cacheRead":0.008342,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009433500000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771250663347}}
