{"type":"message","id":"c4b9c791","parentId":"6f703b7e","timestamp":"2026-02-16T14:05:58.579Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<final>앗, 실례했습니다! **Sam**님, 바로 수정했습니다. `USER.md`에도 반영해 두었으니 이제 잊지 않을게요.\n\nSam님, 오늘 어떤 작업을 도와드릴까요? 🌌 [[reply_to_current]]</final>","textSignature":"ElYKVAG+Pvb7l29rAsA+c7SFc9wUUcIVugPs1Izd5eJ6iOGQzp6JZiItKE89SuQwoYVfZtgMvuBXnHA1XEgwZPzSRnKcXjSTCURsh1k9uuP5bFEgDjxnjA=="}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":3436,"output":68,"cacheRead":16684,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20188,"cost":{"input":0.001718,"output":0.000204,"cacheRead":0.008342,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010264}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771250756811}}
