{"type":"message","id":"59e88a8e","parentId":"8601a82b","timestamp":"2026-02-16T14:13:17.088Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<final>현재 사용 중인 정보는 다음과 같습니다:\n\n*   **OpenClaw 버전:** 2026.2.15 (3fe22ea)\n*   **현재 모델:** google-antigravity/gemini-3-flash\n\n더 궁금하신 점이나 필요한 작업이 있으신가요? 🌌 [[reply_to_current]]</final>","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":20615,"output":154,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20769,"cost":{"input":0.010307499999999999,"output":0.000462,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0107695}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771251194814}}
