{"type":"message","id":"dc558969","parentId":"026c8b2b","timestamp":"2026-02-16T14:18:38.980Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Addressing the Gateway**\n\nI'm currently focused on the \"Gateway probe failed\" error; I need to figure out how to resolve it. I'm also now attempting to identify which Gemini 3 models are available, as the user did request that info previously.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<think>사용자의 요청에 따라 게이트웨이 연결 오류(토큰 불일치) 수리를 시도하고, 사용 가능한 Gemini 3 모델 목록을 확인합니다.\n\n1.  **연결 오류 수리:** `openclaw status --all` 명령어를 통해 상세 상태를 확인하고, 토큰 문제를 해결하기 위한 단서를 찾습니다.\n2.  **Gemini 3 모델 확인:** `session_status`를 통해 현재 세션에서 허용된 모델 목록을 다시 확인합니다.</think>"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1771251518885_10","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/bin/openclaw status --all && /home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/bin/openclaw security audit --deep"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"session_status_1771251518927_11","name":"session_status","arguments":{}},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":28114,"output":691,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28805,"cost":{"input":0.014057,"output":0.002073,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01613}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771251511341}}
