{"type":"message","id":"f09b4048","parentId":"14899786","timestamp":"2026-02-16T14:18:54.336Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"process_1771251534323_12","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"89\n  Port 18789 is already in use.\n  - pid 3197 lfant: openclaw-gateway (127.0.0.1:18789)\n  - Gateway already running locally. Stop it (openclaw gateway stop) or use a different port.\n! Tailscale: off · unknown\n  error: Error: spawn tailscale ENOENT\n✓ Skills: 60 eligible · 0 missing · /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace\n! Channel issues skipped (gateway unreachable)\n\nGateway health:\n  connect failed: unauthorized: device token mismatch (rotate/reissue device token)\n\nPasteable debug report. Auth tokens redacted.\nTroubleshooting: https://docs.openclaw.ai/troubleshooting\n\nOpenClaw security audit\nSummary: 1 critical · 3 warn · 1 info\nRun deeper: openclaw security audit --deep\n\nCRITICAL\nskills.code_safety Skill \"writing-skills\" contains dangerous code patterns\n  Found 1 critical issue(s) in 1 scanned file(s) under /home/lfant/.agents/skills/writing-skills:\n  - [dangerous-exec] Shell command execution detected (child_process) (render-graphs.js:25)\n  Fix: Review the skill source code before use. If untrusted, remove \"/home/lfant/.agents/skills/writing-skills\".\n\nWARN\ngateway.trusted_proxies_missing Reverse proxy headers are not trusted\n  gateway.bind is loopback and gateway.trustedProxies is empty. If you expose the Control UI through a reverse proxy, configure trusted proxies so local-client checks cannot be spoofed.\n  Fix: Set gateway.trustedProxies to your proxy IPs or keep the Control UI local-only.\nfs.state_dir.perms_readable State dir is readable by others\n  /home/lfant/.openclaw mode=755; consider restricting to 700.\n  Fix: chmod 700 /home/lfant/.openclaw\ngateway.probe_failed Gateway probe failed (deep)\n  connect failed: unauthorized: device token mismatch (rotate/reissue device token)\n  Fix: Run \"openclaw status --