{"type":"message","id":"b7df63da","parentId":"3b240cac","timestamp":"2026-02-16T14:27:50.644Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Addressing the Request**\n\nI'm now directly addressing the user's specific request to prioritize the \"gateway connection failure.\" I will check for the root cause. My previous attempt, while addressing a tool call error, didn't fully resolve the underlying issue as indicated by the \"missing tool result.\" I also understand they're wondering if I see their messages.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<think>사용자의 메시지를 잘 보고 있으며, 게이트웨이 연결 실패(토큰 불일치) 문제를 해결하기 위해 조치를 취하고 있습니다.\n\n1.  **메시지 수신 확인:** 사용자의 메시지를 실시간으로 보고 있음을 확인시켜 줍니다.\n2.  **게이트웨이 수리:** `device token mismatch` 오류를 해결하기 위해 게이트웨이를 재시작하고, 상태를 다시 점검합니다.\n3.  **모델 정보:** 현재 사용 가능한 Gemini 3 모델 정보를 정리하여 제공합니다.</think>"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1771252070571_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/bin/openclaw gateway restart && sleep 3 && /home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/bin/openclaw security audit --deep"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":43492,"output":385,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43877,"cost":{"input":0.021745999999999998,"output":0.001155,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022900999999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771252066863}}
